{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 Times New Roman;}{\f1 Courier New;}}\paperw11907\paperh16840\margl1440\margr1440\margt1440\margb1440\f0\fs24 \page\pard\qc\b\fs36 Bharat Innovates 2026 Startup Profile\b0\fs24\par\par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Anusha Bazaar\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\qj \b Sector:\b0  Agri & Food Technologies; Smart Cities and Mobility\par\pard\qj \b Organisation:\b0  Anusha Technologies\par\pard\qj \b Website:\b0  \f1 https://app.anushatechnologies.com\f0 \par\pard\qj \b Location:\b0  [Add City, State, India]\par\pard\qj \b Founder / Lead:\b0  [Add Name]\par\pard\qj \b Contact:\b0  [Add Email] | [Add Phone]\par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 One-Line Pitch\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\qj Anusha Bazaar is a full-stack hyperlocal grocery and essentials commerce platform connecting customers, local stores, administrators, and delivery partners through one secure digital ecosystem.\par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Problem\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\qj Local grocery stores and small retailers often lack integrated technology for online ordering, catalog management, payments, delivery assignment, customer engagement, and operational analytics. Customers expect fast delivery and transparent tracking, while delivery partners need reliable onboarding, verification, order execution, and payout workflows.\par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Solution\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\qj Anusha Bazaar provides a customer app, admin panel, delivery partner app, website, and Spring Boot backend. The platform supports product discovery, cart, checkout, Razorpay payments, Firebase phone authentication, JWT-secured APIs, coupons, referrals, wallet, banners, notifications, delivery partner KYC, admin approval, live delivery flows, payouts, WhatsApp campaigns, and cloud deployment.\par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Innovation\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Complete customer-admin-delivery-backend commerce stack.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Firebase OTP authentication with backend JWT security.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Delivery partner KYC, approval, vehicle, bank, and payout workflow.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Delivery OTP, location updates, and proof-of-delivery support.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Super admin governance with modular permissions, access codes, and audit logs.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Growth tools including referrals, scratch cards, coupons, banners, push notifications, and WhatsApp campaigns.\par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Technology Stack\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab \b Mobile:\b0  React Native, Expo, Firebase, Razorpay.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab \b Web/Admin:\b0  React, TypeScript, Vite, Material UI, Redux Toolkit.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab \b Backend:\b0  Java 17, Spring Boot 3.4.2, Spring Security, JWT, Spring Data JPA.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab \b Cloud:\b0  AWS RDS MySQL, AWS S3, Docker, GitHub Actions, Amazon ECR, EC2.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab \b Engagement:\b0  Firebase Cloud Messaging, WhatsApp campaign support, email service.\par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Impact\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\qj Anusha Bazaar helps digitise local retail, improves access to groceries and essentials, creates delivery partner earning opportunities, supports transparent payments and order records, and provides local merchants with modern commerce tools.\par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Bharat Innovates Fit\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\qj The project fits Bharat Innovates 2026 because it demonstrates applied Indian innovation in food-tech, local commerce digitisation, and mobility-enabled delivery operations. It is suitable for investor interaction, industry collaboration, incubation support, and future AI-based enhancements such as smart search, demand forecasting, recommendation systems, and delivery route optimisation.\par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Current Status\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\qj The repository contains active modules for:\par\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Customer mobile app: \f1 AnushaBazaar-U\f0 \par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Customer website/frontend: \f1 Anushabazaar\f0 \par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Admin panel: \f1 Anushabazaar_Admin_Panel\f0 \par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Delivery partner app: \f1 Anushadeliverypartnerapp\f0 \par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Backend API: \f1 Backend_Original\f0 \par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Support Required\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\qj Funding, incubation, cloud infrastructure support, pilot partnerships, merchant onboarding support, AI/analytics mentorship, and investor access for scaling across multiple local markets.\par}